---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout>

  <section class="hero">

    <h1>Patent Overview</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      The Dual Brain Robotics Architecture is now the subject of a
      U.S. utility provisional patent application.
    </p>

  </section>

  <section class="section">

    <h2>Current Status</h2>

    <p>
      A provisional patent application has been filed covering
      key aspects of the Dual Brain Robotics Architecture.
    </p>

    <div class="patent-box">
      <strong>U.S. Utility-Provisional Patent Application</strong><br />
      Dual Brain Robotics Architecture<br />
      Application No. 64/181,346
    </div>

    <p>
      The filing establishes an early priority date while research,
      development, prototyping, and commercial exploration continue.
    </p>

  </section>

  <section class="section">

    <h2>The Core Idea</h2>

    <p>
      Most artificial intelligence systems are designed around a
      single computational framework.
    </p>

    <p>
      Dual Brain Robotics explores an alternative architecture inspired
      by the cooperative specialization observed in the human brain.
    </p>

    <p>
      The framework proposes two complementary cognitive systems
      operating together through continuous communication,
      coordination, and integration.
    </p>

  </section>

  <section class="section">

    <h2>Potential Advantages</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>Improved contextual awareness</li>
      <li>Enhanced adaptive decision-making</li>
      <li>Greater flexibility in unfamiliar environments</li>
      <li>More natural human interaction</li>
      <li>Robust cognitive redundancy</li>
      <li>Support for advanced self-modeling systems</li>
    </ul>

  </section>

  <section class="section">

    <h2>Research Foundation</h2>

    <p>
      The patent filing draws upon decades of interdisciplinary work
      in social psychology, perception theory, autism research,
      qualitative models, and consciousness studies.
    </p>

    <p>
      The architecture represents an effort to transform those
      theoretical insights into a practical framework for
      artificial intelligence and robotics.
    </p>

  </section>

  <section class="section">

    <h2>Looking Ahead</h2>

    <p>
      The patent filing marks an important milestone, but it is only
      the beginning of the Dual Brain Robotics project.
    </p>

    <p>
      Future work will focus on architecture refinement,
      simulation, prototyping, experimental validation,
      and real-world applications.
    </p>

  </section>

</MainLayout>
